</div><p>Include tracing with OpenTelemetry and JMX exporters for JVM-level insight.</p>
<div class="highlight highlight-kotlin" data-lang="kotlin"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
